{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://solid-checker.dev/schema/typefacts-v1.schema.json",
  "title": "TypeFactsSchema v1 (latest semantic vocabulary)",
  "description": "Length-prefixed deterministic-CBOR request and response frames exchanged with solid-typefacts. Field names are the CBOR map keys. Optional fields are omitted, never null. Handshake protocol 23 (ADR 0038, helper premises) adds optional `parameterPremises` on `exportValueDemand` — stated only beside `localDeclarationLocation`, the types the consumer asks the local declaration's form census be classified under — optional `callArgumentPremises` on `exportImplementationTranscript` — for each call of a *premised* census whose callee is a declaration in the program's own runtime source, the type each informative written argument slot carried on the twin, which is what a consumer hands back as the callee's premise — and optional `identity` on `parameterPremise`, the producer's opaque binding of a premise text to a declaration, echoed byte for byte. A local declaration's transcript may now state `parameterPremises`, equal to the demand's, when its census was classified under them; a protocol-22 consumer refused any premise on a local declaration and never asked for one, so the handshake moves. Handshake protocol 22 (ADR 0038) adds optional `parameterPremises` and `parameterPremiseRefusal` on `exportImplementationTranscript`: when present, the uncensused-form census of that implementation was classified with each parameter bound to the type the export's declared call signature gives its position — the signature a consumer compiles against and a synthesized veto samples from — rather than to the implicit `any` of an unannotated JavaScript parameter, so a coercion or iteration over a parameter declared `number` records no form. An absent list is the strictly more refusing classification over the parameters' own types and never a premise; a present one is a condition a consumer records on whatever it closes. The handshake moves because an empty form list gains a new meaning on a premised transcript. Handshake protocol 18 (ADR 0034) adds optional `subjectParameter` on `uncensusedInvokingForm` — the parameter of the transcript's own declaration at which a read accessor's receiver chain is rooted, stated only for a plain, uninitialized, non-rest parameter written nowhere in its file in a declaration mentioning neither `arguments` nor `eval` — and optional `callReceiver`/`thisParameter` on `implementationCall` for a `.call`/`.apply` whose resolved callee is the default library's Function.prototype member. An absent fact on an older producer is never a statement that the subject is unrooted, so the handshake moves. Handshake protocol 16 adds optional `returnSite.parameter`: positive identity of an unchanged whole input binding, never inferred from a missing fact or concrete return type. Protocol 15 splits control-flow incompleteness into classes and stops withholding call rows. `controlFlowCensus.incompleteness` states, per construct and at its exact location, which of two different things a `unsupported` marker means: `reachability-lower-bound`, a construct walked in full whose enclosed sites are all recorded and none called `unreachable` on its account, so only the *guarantee* is missing and a may-execute enumeration stands; or `flow-unaccounted`, a construct whose flow the census cannot account for at all, which is also the classifier's default so an unclassified marker refuses on arrival. In the same protocol the implementation call census no longer drops a call that lies in a region a `break` or `continue` makes non-universal: the row is emitted with `reach` `unknown`, the weakest non-negative value, because a dropped row is silence and silence is indistinguishable from the absence of the call. An *absent* `incompleteness` beside a nonempty `unsupported` is a producer with no classification, which a consumer must refuse, and no decoder can separate it from a present empty one — so the handshake protocol is the discriminator here too. Handshake protocol 14 added the two facts an implementation census needs: `uncensusedInvokingForms` on `exportImplementationTranscript`, one row per syntactic position that can invoke user code and that `calls` — which holds `CallExpression` and `NewExpression` only — does not record, over a closed twelve-kind vocabulary whose default is the refusing `unclassified-invoking-form`; and `localDeclarationLocation` on `exportValueDemand`, answered by `localDeclaration`, an implementation transcript for the function-like declaration at an exact source range, which is the only way to reach a declaration no export names. An *absent* `uncensusedInvokingForms` is a producer with no opinion and a present empty one is the positive claim that every walked form was a call, a construction, or provably non-invoking; no decoder can separate them, so the handshake protocol is the discriminator and the number moves rather than the fields being merely additive. Protocol 13 added `calleeSources` to the implementation call census: the traced value provenance of the callee expression, from the same tracer and under the same gates that answer `argumentSources` for an argument and `sources` for a return site, with an empty list meaning the producer traced nothing and never a negative claim about the callee. It coexists with `target`/`targetName`/`targetModule`/`declaration`/`calleeParameter`, which state the callee's *resolution* and are unchanged. Protocol 12 added `argumentSources`: per written argument slot, the traced value provenance of the expression written there, and narrowed that tracer's identifier arm to a single-declaration array binding element that is never assigned and carries neither a rest token nor a default, so a `ReturnSite.sources` a protocol-11 producer states may be withheld here. Protocol 11 split the callable-path census into declared members and apparent leaves: every path fact carries `apparent`, true for a member a value has only through the compiler's global-Function augmentation on a node with call or construct signatures. V1 is the sole active lifecycle schema. The retained table remains Wire schema v18 because invocation and exported-value transcripts are demand-shaped side answers rather than retained rows. The producer hashes this file and reports the digest in its startup handshake; both executables additionally ship in build-ID lockstep.",
  "oneOf": [
    { "$ref": "#/$defs/lifecycleRequest" },
    { "$ref": "#/$defs/lifecycleResponse" }
  ],
  "$defs": {
    "bytes": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "CBOR byte string; JSON Schema has no byte-string type."
    },
    "location": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["path", "startByte", "endByte"],
      "properties": {
        "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "startByte": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "endByte": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
      }
    },
    "fileChange": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["path", "version"],
      "properties": {
        "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "version": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "source": { "$ref": "#/$defs/bytes" },
        "deleted": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "entityDemand": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "queryLocation": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "symbol": { "type": "boolean" },
        "typeDescriptor": { "type": "boolean" },
        "resolvedCall": { "type": "boolean" },
        "callability": { "type": "boolean" },
        "constructability": { "type": "boolean" },
        "runtimeValueDomain": { "type": "boolean" },
        "primitiveValueDomain": { "type": "boolean" },
        "primitiveLiteralCandidates": { "type": "boolean" },
        "parameterObjectShape": { "type": "boolean" },
        "callResultDomain": { "type": "boolean" },
        "constantValue": { "type": "boolean" },
        "arrayShape": { "type": "boolean" },
        "tupleShape": { "type": "boolean" },
        "libraryTypes": { "type": "boolean" },
        "referenceSpace": { "type": "boolean" },
        "runtimeIdentity": { "type": "boolean" },
        "references": { "type": "boolean" },
        "async": { "type": "boolean" },
        "structuralAccessor": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "declaration": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["name", "kind", "location"],
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "kind": { "type": "string" },
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" }
      }
    },
    "moduleInventoryDemand": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Selects how much of the resolved module graph one modules operation answers. The module inventory itself is unconditional. Imports with no importPaths covers every file the program included.",
      "properties": {
        "imports": { "type": "boolean" },
        "importPaths": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 } },
        "packages": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "projectReferenceMapping": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["source", "outputDts"],
      "description": "The compiler's own pairing of one input file with the declaration file emitted from it. Present only where a configured project reference covers the file, and the only declaration-to-implementation pairing TypeScript maintains. A shipped .d.ts beside a .js never has one.",
      "properties": {
        "source": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "outputDts": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
      }
    },
    "moduleFact": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["path"],
      "description": "One file the TypeScript program resolved and included, as the program holds it. For a module reached through a symlink the path is the realpath.",
      "properties": {
        "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "declarationFile": { "type": "boolean" },
        "format": { "enum": ["commonjs", "esm", "preserve"] },
        "projectReference": { "$ref": "#/$defs/projectReferenceMapping" },
        "redirectTargets": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 } }
      }
    },
    "packageIdentity": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["manifestPath"],
      "description": "The nearest enclosing package.json found by the compiler's own package-scope lookup, and that manifest's own name and version. An absent name or version is a fact about the manifest, not a lookup failure.",
      "properties": {
        "manifestPath": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "version": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "resolverPackageId": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "The package identity the resolver itself recorded while resolving one specifier. It can name a different package than the nearest enclosing manifest. subpath is the selected file's path within the package, not the exports key that led there.",
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "subpath": { "type": "string" },
        "version": { "type": "string" },
        "peerDependencies": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "moduleImportFact": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["specifier", "text", "resolution"],
      "description": "One module specifier occurrence and what the compiler's resolver recorded for it. resolvedPath is empty exactly when resolution is unresolved. symlinkPath is populated only where the resolver's own realpath differed from the path it walked. includedPath is populated only where the program parses a different file than the one resolved, which happens for a configured project reference's declaration output and for nothing else.",
      "properties": {
        "specifier": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "text": { "type": "string" },
        "resolution": { "enum": ["unresolved", "relative", "nodeModules", "nonRelative"] },
        "resolvedPath": { "type": "string" },
        "includedPath": { "type": "string" },
        "symlinkPath": { "type": "string" },
        "extension": { "type": "string" },
        "tsExtension": { "type": "boolean" },
        "pathsPattern": { "type": "string" },
        "package": { "$ref": "#/$defs/packageIdentity" },
        "resolverPackage": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolverPackageId" }
      }
    },
    "symbolQuery": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["id"],
      "properties": {
        "id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "references": { "type": "boolean" },
        "referencesOnly": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "symbolFact": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["id"],
      "properties": {
        "id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "aliasTarget": { "type": "string" },
        "declarations": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/declaration" } },
        "references": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" } }
      }
    },
    "compactDemands": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["groups", "strings"],
      "description": "Demand snapshot with one string dictionary per frame; index 0 is the empty string. Each group is [pathIndex, packedRows] where packedRows holds unsigned LEB128 (flags << 1 | hasQuery, startDelta, length) triples, each optionally followed by (queryPath, queryStart, queryLength). Bit 9 requests runtimeValueDomain, bit 10 requests callResultDomain, bit 11 requests constantValue, bit 12 requests arrayShape, bit 13 requests tupleShape, bit 14 requests libraryTypes, bit 15 requests primitiveValueDomain, bit 16 requests constructability, bit 17 requests primitiveLiteralCandidates, and bit 18 requests parameterObjectShape.",
      "properties": {
        "groups": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000000,
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 2,
            "maxItems": 2,
            "prefixItems": [
              { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
              { "$ref": "#/$defs/bytes" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "strings": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "invocationDemand": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "callableDepth": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 8 },
        "census": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "exportValueDemand": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "implementationLocation": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "localDeclarationLocation": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "callableDepth": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 8 },
        "parameterPremises": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterPremise" } }
      }
    },
    "typeDescriptor": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": { "type": "string" },
        "originModule": { "type": "string" },
        "aliasDeclarations": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/declaration" } }
      }
    },
    "declarationOwner": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind", "location"],
      "properties": {
        "symbol": { "type": "string" },
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "kind": { "type": "string" },
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" }
      }
    },
    "resolvedDeclaration": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind", "location"],
      "properties": {
        "symbol": { "type": "string" },
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "kind": { "type": "string" },
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "owners": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/declarationOwner" } },
        "qualifiedName": { "type": "string" },
        "originModule": { "type": "string" },
        "sourceFile": { "type": "string" },
        "standardLibrary": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "callTargetSet": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "exhaustive": { "type": "boolean" },
        "candidates": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolvedDeclaration" } }
      }
    },
    "primitiveLiteral": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind"],
      "properties": {
        "kind": { "enum": ["string", "number", "boolean"] },
        "string": { "type": "string" },
        "number": { "type": "number" },
        "boolean": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "discriminant": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["property", "value"],
      "properties": {
        "property": { "type": "string" },
        "value": { "$ref": "#/$defs/primitiveLiteral" }
      }
    },
    "pathSegment": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind"],
      "properties": {
        "kind": { "enum": ["property", "tuple"] },
        "property": { "type": "string" },
        "index": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
      }
    },
    "callablePath": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["alternative", "presence", "callability", "constructability", "apparent", "subtreeEnumerated"],
      "properties": {
        "alternative": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "path": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 8, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/pathSegment" } },
        "presence": { "enum": ["required", "optional", "absent", "unknown"] },
        "callability": { "enum": ["callable", "untypedCallable", "nonCallable", "mixed", "unknown"] },
        "constructability": { "enum": ["constructable", "nonConstructable", "mixed", "unknown"] },
        "declaration": { "$ref": "#/$defs/declaration" },
        "complete": { "type": "boolean" },
        "apparent": { "type": "boolean" },
        "subtreeEnumerated": { "type": "boolean" },
        "openReasons": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "valueAlternative": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["index"],
      "properties": {
        "index": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "discriminants": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/discriminant" } },
        "openReasons": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "finiteCase": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind"],
      "properties": {
        "kind": { "type": "string" },
        "literal": { "$ref": "#/$defs/primitiveLiteral" },
        "protocol": { "enum": ["plain", "promise", "asyncIterable"] },
        "tupleLength": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "discriminants": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/discriminant" } }
      }
    },
    "finitePartition": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["axis"],
      "properties": {
        "axis": { "enum": ["literal", "callability", "protocol", "tuple", "discriminant"] },
        "complete": { "type": "boolean" },
        "cases": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/finiteCase" } }
      }
    },
    "valuePrimitiveDomain": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "mayBeString": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mayBeNumber": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mayBeBoolean": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mayBeBigInt": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mayBeSymbol": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mayBeNull": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mayBeUndefined": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mayBeObject": { "type": "boolean" },
        "numbersFinite": { "type": "boolean" },
        "unknown": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "invocationValue": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["callability", "constructability", "primitive"],
      "properties": {
        "type": { "$ref": "#/$defs/typeDescriptor" },
        "callability": { "enum": ["callable", "untypedCallable", "nonCallable", "mixed", "unknown"] },
        "constructability": { "enum": ["constructable", "nonConstructable", "mixed", "unknown"] },
        "primitive": { "$ref": "#/$defs/valuePrimitiveDomain" },
        "alternatives": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/valueAlternative" } },
        "partitions": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/finitePartition" } },
        "openReasons": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "selectedParameter": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["index", "value"],
      "properties": {
        "index": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "symbol": { "type": "string" },
        "declaration": { "$ref": "#/$defs/declaration" },
        "rest": { "type": "boolean" },
        "optional": { "type": "boolean" },
        "defaulted": { "type": "boolean" },
        "value": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationValue" },
        "declaredType": { "$ref": "#/$defs/declaredTypeReference" },
        "callablePaths": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callablePath" } }
      }
    },
    "selectedSignature": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["identity", "declaration", "overloadOrdinal", "overloadCount", "minimumArgumentCount", "result"],
      "properties": {
        "identity": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$" },
        "declaration": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolvedDeclaration" },
        "overloadOrdinal": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "overloadCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "minimumArgumentCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "hasRest": { "type": "boolean" },
        "parameters": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/selectedParameter" } },
        "result": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationValue" },
        "resultCallablePaths": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callablePath" } }
      }
    },
    "expandedArgumentSlot": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["expandedIndex", "parameterIndex"],
      "properties": {
        "expandedIndex": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "tupleIndex": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "parameterIndex": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "rest": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "formalRange": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["start"],
      "properties": {
        "start": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "endExclusive": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "unbounded": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "argumentBinding": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["argumentIndex", "location", "disposition"],
      "properties": {
        "argumentIndex": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "disposition": { "enum": ["direct", "exactTupleSpread", "unknownLengthSpread", "unmapped"] },
        "slots": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/expandedArgumentSlot" } },
        "possible": { "$ref": "#/$defs/formalRange" },
        "reason": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "parameterUse": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["parameterIndex", "location", "reach", "kind"],
      "properties": {
        "parameterIndex": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "bindingPath": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 8, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/pathSegment" } },
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "kind": { "enum": ["directCall", "aliasCall", "argumentKnown", "argumentUnknown", "propertyAccess", "return", "storage", "capture", "unknownEscape"] },
        "alias": { "type": "boolean" },
        "captured": { "type": "boolean" }
      }
    },
    "returnSite": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "reach"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "value": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationValue" },
        "parameter": { "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterValueSource" },
        "carriedCallables": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" } },
        "carryReach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "sources": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/implementationValueSource" } }
      }
    },
    "callableReturnCarrySite": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "reach"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "carryReach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "carriedCallables": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callableCarryBinding" } }
      }
    },
    "callableCarryBinding": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "reach"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] }
      }
    },
    "callableReturnCensus": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["callable"],
      "properties": {
        "callable": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "returns": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callableReturnCarrySite" } }
      }
    },
    "throwSite": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "reach"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] }
      }
    },
    "branchSite": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "reach"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "partitions": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/finitePartition" } }
      }
    },
    "controlFlowIncompleteness": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["marker", "class", "location"],
      "description": "One construct whose flow this control-flow census does not fully model, at its exact location, classified by what is missing. `reachability-lower-bound` is a construct walked in full — every enclosed site is recorded and none is called `unreachable` on its account — whose *guarantee* alone is unmodelled, so a may-execute enumeration of the callables inside it stands. `flow-unaccounted` is a construct whose flow the census cannot account for in either direction, and it is also the classifier's default, so a marker nobody classified refuses on arrival. The class enum is closed: an unrecognized string rejects the whole transcript. Every marker in `unsupported` has at least one row here and every row's marker is in `unsupported`.",
      "properties": {
        "marker": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "class": { "enum": ["reachability-lower-bound", "flow-unaccounted"] },
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" }
      }
    },
    "controlFlowCensus": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "returns": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/returnSite" } },
        "throws": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/throwSite" } },
        "branches": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/branchSite" } },
        "unsupported": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "incompleteness": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/controlFlowIncompleteness" } }
      }
    },
    "invocationTranscript": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "validity", "kind"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "validity": { "enum": ["valid", "recovery", "unresolved"] },
        "kind": { "enum": ["unknown", "call", "construct"] },
        "target": { "type": "string" },
        "targets": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callTargetSet" },
        "selectedSignature": { "$ref": "#/$defs/selectedSignature" },
        "bindings": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/argumentBinding" } },
        "omittedParameters": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 } },
        "parameterUses": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterUse" } },
        "controlFlow": { "$ref": "#/$defs/controlFlowCensus" },
        "complete": { "type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": { "enum": ["signature", "bindings", "omissions", "parameters", "result", "uses", "controlFlow"] } },
        "openReasons": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "exportValueTranscript": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "value"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "queryName": { "type": "string" },
        "target": { "type": "string" },
        "declaration": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolvedDeclaration" },
        "value": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationValue" },
        "callablePaths": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callablePath" } },
        "callSignature": { "$ref": "#/$defs/selectedSignature" },
        "callSignatures": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/selectedSignature" } },
        "implementation": { "$ref": "#/$defs/exportImplementationTranscript" },
        "localDeclaration": { "$ref": "#/$defs/exportImplementationTranscript" },
        "complete": { "type": "boolean" },
        "openReasons": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "parameterValueSource": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["parameterIndex"],
      "properties": {
        "parameterIndex": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "path": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/pathSegment" } }
      }
    },
    "implementationValueSource": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind"],
      "properties": {
        "path": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 8, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/pathSegment" } },
        "kind": { "enum": ["directCallable", "callResult"] },
        "target": { "type": "string" },
        "targetName": { "type": "string" },
        "targetModule": { "type": "string" },
        "targetPath": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 8, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/pathSegment" } }
      }
    },
    "declaredTypeReference": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["name", "module"],
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "module": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
      }
    },
    "implementationCall": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location", "reach"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "kind": { "enum": ["unknown", "call", "construct"] },
        "target": { "type": "string" },
        "targetName": { "type": "string" },
        "targetModule": { "type": "string" },
        "declaration": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolvedDeclaration" },
        "calleeParameter": { "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterValueSource" },
        "callReceiver": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolvedDeclaration" },
        "thisParameter": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "argumentParameters": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "anyOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterValueSource" }, { "type": "null" }] } },
        "argumentSources": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/implementationValueSource" } } },
        "calleeSources": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/implementationValueSource" } },
        "captured": { "type": "boolean" },
        "enclosingCallable": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "argumentCallables": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/implementationArgumentCallable" } },
        "defaultLibraryInvoker": { "enum": ["setTimeout", "setInterval", "queueMicrotask", "requestAnimationFrame", "requestIdleCallback", "addEventListener", "promiseThen", "promiseCatch", "promiseFinally", "arrayIteration", "promiseConstructor"] },
        "invokedArguments": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 } },
        "calleeDirectlyCalledParameters": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 } },
        "calleeInvokedParameters": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 } },
        "calleeStronglyInvokedParameters": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 } },
        "calleePendingInvocations": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/calleePendingInvocation" } }
      }
    },
    "uncensusedInvokingForm": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["kind", "nodeKind", "location", "reach"],
      "description": "One syntactic position that can invoke user code and that the implementation call census does not record. The kind enum is closed: an unrecognized string rejects the whole transcript rather than degrading to an unknown row. An absent uncensusedInvokingForms array is a producer with no opinion, which a consumer must refuse; a present empty array is the positive claim that every walked form was a call, a construction, or provably non-invoking.",
      "properties": {
        "kind": { "enum": ["tagged-template", "get-accessor", "set-accessor", "property-access-unknown-accessor", "decorator", "iteration-protocol", "using-dispose", "instanceof", "await-then", "coercion", "jsx-element", "unclassified-invoking-form"] },
        "nodeKind": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "reach": { "enum": ["reachable", "unreachable", "unknown"] },
        "enclosingCallable": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "captured": { "type": "boolean" },
        "subjectParameter": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
      }
    },
    "implementationArgumentCallable": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["argument"],
      "properties": {
        "argument": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "locations": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" } }
      }
    },
    "calleePendingInvocation": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["parameter"],
      "properties": {
        "parameter": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "strong": { "type": "boolean" },
        "requires": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 4, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invokingSlotPremise" } }
      }
    },
    "invokingSlotPremise": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["module", "name", "slot", "argumentCount"],
      "properties": {
        "module": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "slot": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "argumentCount": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
      }
    },
    "exportImplementationTranscript": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["location"],
      "properties": {
        "location": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "queryName": { "type": "string" },
        "target": { "type": "string" },
        "declaration": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolvedDeclaration" },
        "signature": { "$ref": "#/$defs/selectedSignature" },
        "completionForm": { "type": "string", "enum": ["plain", "async", "generator", "async-generator", "unclassified"] },
        "implementationOf": { "$ref": "#/$defs/resolvedDeclaration" },
        "parameterUses": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterUse" } },
        "controlFlow": { "$ref": "#/$defs/controlFlowCensus" },
        "callableReturns": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callableReturnCensus" } },
        "calls": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/implementationCall" } },
        "uncensusedInvokingForms": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/uncensusedInvokingForm" } },
        "parameterPremises": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterPremise" } },
        "parameterPremiseRefusal": { "type": "string" },
        "callArgumentPremises": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/callArgumentPremise" } },
        "complete": { "type": "boolean" },
        "openReasons": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "parameterPremise": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["index", "type"],
      "description": "One parameter of the transcript's implementation bound to a type, under which uncensusedInvokingForms was classified (ADR 0038, handshake protocols 22 and 23). On an export's root implementation, type is the declared type's printed form, byte-identical to the export transcript's selectedSignature.parameters[index].value.type.text, and identity is absent. On a local declaration's transcript the entries equal the demand's exportValueDemand.parameterPremises, which the consumer copied from the caller's callArgumentPremises for the call it followed; identity is the producer's opaque binding of the text to a declaration (type flags and declaration positions), compared byte for byte and never interpreted by a consumer.",
      "properties": {
        "index": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "type": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "identity": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "callArgumentPremise": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["call", "arguments"],
      "description": "The type each informative written argument slot of one call carried on the twin a premised uncensused-form census ran over (handshake protocol 23). call is the location of a row of the transcript's calls, in the original file's bytes; arguments has strictly increasing indexes, and a slot it omits was `any` or unspellable. Stated only on a transcript that also states parameterPremises, and only for a call with no spread whose callee is an identifier resolving to a declaration in the program's own runtime source.",
      "properties": {
        "call": { "$ref": "#/$defs/location" },
        "arguments": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/parameterPremise" } }
      }
    },
    "transcriptSourceDigest": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["path", "sha256"],
      "properties": {
        "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "sha256": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$" }
      }
    },
    "invocationEnvelope": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["generation", "demandSha256", "moduleGraphSha256"],
      "properties": {
        "projectId": { "type": "string" },
        "generation": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "demandSha256": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$" },
        "moduleGraphSha256": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$" },
        "schemaSha256": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$" },
        "producerBuild": { "type": "string" },
        "sources": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/transcriptSourceDigest" } },
        "openReasons": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "lifecycleRequest": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["schema", "requestId", "operation", "projectId", "generation"],
      "properties": {
        "schema": { "const": 1 },
        "requestId": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "operation": {
          "enum": ["open", "update", "analyze", "symbols", "sources", "modules", "invocations", "export-values", "cancel", "close"]
        },
        "projectId": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "generation": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "changes": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/fileChange" } },
        "demands": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entityDemand" } },
        "compactDemands": { "$ref": "#/$defs/compactDemands" },
        "stateToken": { "type": "string" },
        "resetState": { "type": "boolean" },
        "removedDemandPaths": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "symbolQueries": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/symbolQuery" } },
        "releaseAnalysis": { "type": "boolean" },
        "referenceChanges": { "type": "boolean" },
        "referencePaths": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 } },
        "cancelRequestId": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "moduleGraph": { "$ref": "#/$defs/moduleInventoryDemand" },
        "invocationDemands": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationDemand" } },
        "exportValueDemands": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/exportValueDemand" } }
      }
    },
    "timings": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["analyzeNs"],
      "properties": {
        "requestDecodeNs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "analyzeNs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "asyncNs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "demandNs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "assemblyNs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "sortNs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "closeSymbolsNs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "materialized": { "type": "boolean" },
        "retainedFiles": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "recomputedFiles": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "nonDurableFiles": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
      }
    },
    "lifecycleResponse": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["schema", "requestId", "projectId", "generation", "ok"],
      "description": "Analyze carries at most one opaque tableTransition. The transition proves its base project, generation, and state token and selects full or delta mode internally. An absent transition reuses the retained table. The modules operation instead carries modules, moduleImports, and unknownImportPaths as plain rows: the resolved module graph is a property of the accepted program rather than of a demand set, so it takes no part in retained table identity.",
      "properties": {
        "schema": { "const": 1 },
        "requestId": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "projectId": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
        "generation": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "tableTransition": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/bytes",
          "description": "Opaque full-or-delta Wire table transition. The active lifecycle schema emits Wire table schema v17. V15 introduced untypedCallable (tag 4), v16 added primitive literal candidates, and v17 added parameter object-construction shapes; older table schemas remain frozen and reject facts they cannot represent."
        },
        "symbolEvidence": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/symbolFact" } },
        "referenceEvidence": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/symbolFact" } },
        "changedReferenceSymbols": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 } },
        "referenceChangesExact": { "type": "boolean" },
        "stateToken": { "type": "string" },
        "affected": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "sources": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000000,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["path"],
            "properties": {
              "path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
              "source": { "$ref": "#/$defs/bytes" },
              "local": { "type": "boolean" }
            }
          }
        },
        "sourceArena": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Filesystem path to a temporary file holding every source body back to back, sliced by sourceLengths. Implies a producer and client that share a filesystem."
        },
        "sourceLengths": { "type": "array", "maxItems": 1000000, "items": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 } },
        "modules": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000000,
          "description": "Every file the program included, ordered by path. A modules operation always answers it.",
          "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/moduleFact" }
        },
        "moduleImports": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000000,
          "description": "Resolved provenance for the requested files' module specifiers, ordered by importing path then by specifier start byte.",
          "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/moduleImportFact" }
        },
        "unknownImportPaths": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000000,
          "description": "Requested import paths the program does not hold, ordered by path. Reported rather than dropped so a caller can tell a file with no imports from a file that was never analyzed.",
          "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
        },
        "invocationTranscripts": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000000,
          "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationTranscript" }
        },
        "invocationEnvelope": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationEnvelope" },
        "exportValueTranscripts": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 1000000,
          "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/exportValueTranscript" }
        },
        "exportValueEnvelope": { "$ref": "#/$defs/invocationEnvelope" },
        "timings": { "$ref": "#/$defs/timings" },
        "error": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["code", "message"],
          "properties": {
            "code": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
            "message": { "type": "string" }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
